{
  "bookId": "hero-214104",
  "id": "bond-28592",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28592001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "咦，总是循规蹈矩的人类也会准备惊喜呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28592003",
              "text": "毕竟是为了爱丽丝。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28592003",
              "text": "是献给爱丽丝的礼物。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28592002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "嘻嘻，正好，爱丽丝最喜欢惊喜了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "嘎吱——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "哦？这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "爱丽丝不是之前和我描述过地下奇境吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我就尝试还原了一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "哇哈哈哈！很像！很像那时的玫瑰花园哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28592010",
              "text": "你喜欢就好。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28592010",
              "text": "太好了！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28592009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "哇，还有好多可爱的纸牌扑克士兵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就是关节没办法动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "没关系，爱丽丝最擅长让大家的关节扭动起来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "唉？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "下次一起做扑克兵吧，然后也放到这个花园里~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原来是这个意思，吓我一跳。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "对了对了，这个门也可以用我的金色钥匙打开~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是，这是我画上去的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592018",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "嘎吱——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28592019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "来，我们一起去寻找新的奇境吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
